From f59f08475aae2e349d8d1c0807546ff76bacd5d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Apr 2026 06:23:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix: Increment unlootedCount for AoE-merged loot items
 (I-137)

Items merged from nearby corpses into the main creature's loot were not
incrementing unlootedCount, causing uint8 underflow when looted. This
made isLooted() permanently false, preventing AllLootRemovedFromCorpse()
from firing and the skinnable flag from being set.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/aoe_loot.cpp | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/aoe_loot.cpp b/src/aoe_loot.cpp
index b72b515..d99111f 100644
--- a/src/aoe_loot.cpp
+++ b/src/aoe_loot.cpp
@@ -228,7 +228,11 @@ bool AOELootServer::CanPacketReceive(WorldSession* session, WorldPacket const& p
     for (const auto& item : itemsToAdd)
     {
         if (mainLoot->items.size() < MAX_LOOT_ITEMS)
+        {
             mainLoot->items.push_back(item);
+            if (!item.is_looted)
+                ++mainLoot->unlootedCount;
+        }
     }
 
     // Add quest items directly to player inventory
-- 
2.34.1


From e441fe1495bcd8f4a9ed6c2f8f2e2e017188562a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Apr 2026 06:24:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix: Add SET NAMES to fix MySQL 8.4 collation mismatch
 (I-143)

MySQL 8.4 defaults connection collation to utf8mb4_0900_ai_ci, which
clashes with the module_string table's utf8mb4_unicode_ci, causing
DELETE/INSERT to fail with Error 1267 and blocking 'zep world sql
changed' until -k was passed to skip errors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 data/sql/db-world/base/aoe_loot_module_string.sql | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/data/sql/db-world/base/aoe_loot_module_string.sql b/data/sql/db-world/base/aoe_loot_module_string.sql
index eb99b3a..f237d5f 100644
--- a/data/sql/db-world/base/aoe_loot_module_string.sql
+++ b/data/sql/db-world/base/aoe_loot_module_string.sql
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+SET NAMES utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;
 SET @MODULE_STRING := 'mod-aoe-loot';
 
 -- module string
-- 
2.34.1


From 063f71b8c277dd613b36dd577fe955806a3bbf6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 11:32:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix: Group-safe partial merge + solo-group auto-greed
 (I-137)

- Merge only plain items (not FFA/conditional/quest-flagged) - merged
  copies of per-player-list items were invisible and unlootable in the
  merged window, leaving unlootedCount stuck above zero so the main
  corpse never became skinnable (I-137 recurrence)
- Mark merged items looted on the source corpse instead of clear(), so
  leftover FFA/conditional/quest items stay individually lootable
- Never touch corpses that were already opened (loot windows / rolls
  reference their slots) or that are round-robin assigned to another
  group member
- In roll-based loot methods, leave over-threshold items for the group
  roll; exception: sole-member groups with AOELoot.AutoGreedSolo, where
  merged items enter the merged window's roll and resolve instantly
- Auto-greed loot rolls when the player is the only group member
  (AOELoot.AutoGreedSolo, default on)
- Quest items go to bags with stock StoreLootItem bookkeeping instead
  of being destroyed with the source loot

